# Project Context

This project studies motor imagery EEG cross-session domain generalization on WBCIC-SHU 2025 and SHU 2022.

Current research chain: drift diagnostic -> baseline -> multi-source baseline -> no-learning alignment -> prototype drift analysis -> adaptation/memory/agent. Completed facts: WBCIC-SHU preprocessing/QC, drift diagnostic, baseline, multi-source, and no-learning alignment are done. Prototype Drift and online adaptation are future until explicitly run.

Use `code/run.py` as the human entry. Add new datasets/models/methods/experiments only in the matching `code/` layer plus config and documentation updates.
